20:28:02|INFO   |--- sample T03:size_k_heap:veto:r3:p0:s0 (78 tokens, stop):
```python
import heapq

def solve(nums, k):
    heap = []
    for num in nums:
        if len(heap) < k:
            heapq.heappUSH(heap, -num)
        else:
            if num < - heap[0]:
                heapq.heappop(heap)
                heapq.heappUSH(heap, -num)
    return - heap[0]
```
